  m_Name: Chart - the course is pulled
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.VisualScripting.Flow::Unity.VisualScripting.ScriptGraphAsset
  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Chart - the course is pulled","summary":"A knot of her course has been let go on the chart, pulled again, or taken off (Code/Game/Voyage/CoursePulls.cs; the chart''s pulling is in Map/MapView.cs). Here the knot is taken to the water where it lay on land, her course is laid again through her knots by the lanes (Course.SetThrough), and the log is told. Whether a press takes the line at all is the rule graph''s (Game/Graphs/Rules: does the press take the line).","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"91df96d2-b418-47a5-9dd1-d63876ab3b17","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.OnTheCourseIsPulled","$id":"9"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":460.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"55336710-25f9-431f-8d16-b3e68976d732","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":860.0,"y":-40.0},"guid":"de99b872-b673-4914-b660-95e92c0512d0","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.KnotToWater","$id":"13"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1300.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"c805ad49-071a-443f-980c-763a6fcad051","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.LayThroughKnots","$id":"15"},{"defaultValues":{"words":{"$content":"","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"75473397-d7ce-47a5-9602-ef50ebb96abe","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.CourseSay","$id":"17"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"06fcfe3f-2bc4-445e-bac8-3e3661aec3e5","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"ifTrue","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"24b8373e-5d4b-4c24-90c4-5080096aa5de","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"ff17cfe4-6bf4-4aaf-8bab-3c9f945e3df7","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"ifFalse","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"4a0615dc-7228-412e-b362-bbee3b6771bb","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"578047f4-4edd-4054-b8d0-6bf9038ee499","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"onLand","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"destinationKey":"condition","guid":"760b7810-b316-4fba-a9a3-6733a43aebdd","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"sourceKey":"words","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"17"},"destinationKey":"words","guid":"d26b363f-ef47-4c39-a4a8-a5a8970ba082","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-90.0,"xMax":2260.0,"yMax":330.0},"label":"The course is pulled","comment":"Your ruling of 13 October 2026: pull the line anywhere; by the lanes through your point; a point let go on land goes to the nearest water; a point may be let go in the dark.","color":{"r":0.32,"g":0.55,"b":0.32,"a":1.0},"guid":"71f231a5-f37a-472e-b495-9dc78b3a3599","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-20.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":540.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The moments","body":"pulled: a new knot was let go on the line. It goes among her knots by the point of the line it was pulled from.\nmoved: a knot she already had was pulled again.\noff: a knot was taken off (a right click on it).\nOn land: the point let go lies on dry land or the sands, by the world bake.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"3b85e562-d0c9-4675-b3aa-26997df36309","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":580.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1140.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"The words","body":"The words come from the laying (\"Her course is laid again through your knot: 212 km, about 2.5 days.\"): PLACEHOLDER WORDS, in CoursePulls.cs, the user''s to write. Where no water leads through the point, her course stands as it was and the log says so. The clock does not drop back for a pull: it is the player''s own hand.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"76bd10bf-eef2-43c3-8e00-6aa846ce7490","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1180.0,"yMin":200.0,"xMax":1740.0,"yMax":460.0},"title":"What is not here","body":"The pointer on the chart (which press takes the line, the knot following the hand, the right click) and the laying itself by the lanes are the code''s (MapView.cs, Course.cs). How near the pointer must be to the line is the rule graph \"Rule - does the press take the line\".","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ef21281d-7721-449b-a71f-30b3b4b0d1d2","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
